OL,3,ARolls-Royce signs 'multi-million'
OL,4,Aengine deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FRolls-Royce has moved forward with a
OL,7,Fdeal to power a new fleet of Airbus
OL,8,Flong-haul jets for Philippine Airlines.
OL,10,FThe FTSE-100 firm will provide 18
OL,11,Fengines for nine new Airbus A350-1000
OL,12,Faircraft in a deal worth "hundreds of
OL,13,Fmillions of pounds".
OL,15,FThe agreement, once finalised, also
OL,16,Fincludes a maintenance package, meaning
OL,17,FRolls-Royce will continue servicing and
OL,18,Fmonitoring the engines throughout their
OL,19,Foperational life, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
